<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0006/na_0027> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Agent-silver normative structure derived from exact source wording; human adjudication is required." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0006/tu_0038> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Routine administration of statins in patients with HF without other indications for their use (e.g. CAD) is not recommended. Because there is no evidence of harm in patients on statin treatment after the occurrence of HF, there is no need for statin discontinuation for patients already on treatment" .
