<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0006/e_0008> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/Drug> .
