<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0006/tu_0011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "– Type: exercises that involve large muscle groups (e.g. walking, running, bicycle riding) Supervised, in-hospital training programme may be recommended, especially during the initial phases, to verify individual responses and tolerability, clinical stability and promptly identify signs and symptoms indicating to modify or terminate the ET programme." .
